<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11244" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαίρω</span></b>  (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαείρω</span>), fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπᾱρῶ</span>: aor. 1
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπῆρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IT</u>
					967
				</span></i>
			: pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπῆρκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					8.100
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				2.82
			</span></i>: 
				Ion.
			
			impf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαιρέεσκον,</span>
			
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαίρεσκον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.186
			</span></i>:—<i>lift off,</i> and so, <i>carry off, take
				away,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ξύλα</span> ibid.; <i>remove,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					1608
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ Σπάρτης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					1671
				</span></i>
			; in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IT</u>
				967
			</span></i>, perh. <i>get rid of,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νικῶν ἀπῆρα φόνια πειρατήρια</span>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαίρεται τράπεζα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Achae.
					17.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπό τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
					9.15
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>lead</i> or <i>carry away,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς νέας ἀπὸ Σαλαμῖνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.57
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελάθρων ἀ. πόδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>El.</u>
					774
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τινὰ ἐκ χθονός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					1520
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> elliptically
			(sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναῦς, στρατόν,</span> etc.),
				<i>sail away, march away, depart,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαίρειν ἀπὸ Σαλαμῖνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.60
				</span></i>
			, freq. in <i><span class="en">
				Th.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
			</span></i>, etc.: c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαίρειν χθονός</span>
			<i>depart from</i> the land, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Cyc.</u>
				131
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σπάρτης ἀπῆρας νηΐ Κρησίαν χθόνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					944
				</span></i>
			: c. acc. cogn., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πρεσβείαν</span>
			<i>to set out on</i> an embassy, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				19.163
			</span></i>.</div>
